|desc=
Allows you to wield a physical melee or ranged weapon, a mindstar or a gem telekinetically, gaining a special effect for each.

''Note: To wield a different item, use the {{t|Telekinetic Grasp}} talent.''

A gem will provide +3 bonus to all primary stats per tier of the gem.

A mindstar will randomly try to telekinetically grab a far away foe (10% chance and range 3 for a tier 1 mindstar, +1 range and +5% chance for each tier above 1) and pull it into melee range.

A physical melee weapon will act as a semi independent entity, automatically attacking adjacent foes each turn, while a ranged weapon will fire at your target whenever you perform a ranged attack.
''Note: Ranged weapons used this way must correspond to your equipped ammo type, and the extra shots from this consumes additional ammo if the original attack used ammo.''

While this talent is active, all melee and ranged attacks ''(with all weapons)'' will use 60% of your Cunning and Willpower in place of Dexterity and Strength for accuracy and damage calculations respectively. 
''Note: This means that for example a dagger wielded in any slot which would usually use 50% Dexterity and 50% Strength will instead use 30% Willpower and 30% Cunning.''

''In-game, details of the currently-wielded item are listed here.''

''Note: This is automatically learned upon learning any of the [[Mindslayer]]'s {{ct|Psionic}} talents, except for {{c|Augmented Mobility}} talents (since they are available from [[Escorts]], etc).''
